WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.669
Dave, I heard you say in an interview,

2
00:00:01.669 --> 00:00:04.792
this was an emotional journey for you, this movie.

3
00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:07.175
And then thought, it's Lego Ninjago,

4
00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:09.149
