9
00:00:18.621 --> 00:00:20.292
(clearing throat)
Excuse me.

10
00:00:20.292 --> 00:00:21.775
Good timing for a voice crack,

11
00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:24.369
I'm still livin' through it.

12
00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:25.723
Crying uncontrollably.

13
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:26.556
Yeah.

14
00:00:26.556 --> 00:00:30.072
And kind of like crying harder than I do

15
00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:32.863
in a movie where I play a recovering heroin addict.

16
00:00:32.863 --> 00:00:33.696
[Conan] Yeah.

17
00:00:33.696 --> 00:00:34.529
(audience laughing)

18
00:00:34.529 --> 00:00:37.623
Then we finished the scene and I kinda

19
00:00:37.623 --> 00:00:39.350
took a step back and evaluated the room

20
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.753
and it was some interesting energy

21
00:00:40.753 --> 00:00:44.127
and I realized I was playing a green ninja

22
00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.954
Lego piece and I needed to reel it in a bit, yeah.

23
00:00:46.954 --> 00:00:49.204
(laughing)

